 ScrollView scroll=new ScrollView(this);root.addView(scroll,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(-1,0,1));body=new LinearLayout(this);body.setOrientation(1);pad(body,18,12,18,20);scroll.addView(body);body.setAlpha(0f);body.setTranslationY(dp(14));body.animate().alpha(1f).translationY(0).setDuration(330).start();
 if(page.equals("Главная"))home();else if(page.equals("Карты"))cards();else if(page.equals("Переводы"))transfer();else if(page.equals("История"))transactions();else if(page.equals("Профиль"))profile();else if(page.equals("Маркет"))market();else if(page.equals("Кейс"))casePage();else if(page.equals("Сервисы"))services();else if(page.equals("Сайты"))sites();else profile();
 TextView disclaimer=txt("Тестовое приложение · операции не являются реальными платежами",10,MUTED,false);disclaimer.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);pad(disclaimer,4,18,4,8);add(body,disclaimer);
 nav=new LinearLayout(this);nav.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);pad(nav,8,9,8,10);nav.setBackground(shape(PANEL,22));String[] tabs={"Главная","Карты","Переводы","Сайты","Профиль"};String[] icons={"⌂","▤","⇄","✦","☺"};for(int i=0;i<tabs.length;i++){final String p=tabs[i];boolean active=p.equals(page);LinearLayout item=new LinearLayout(this);item.setOrientation(1);item.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);pad(item,2,5,2,4);TextView symbol=txt(icons[i],23,active?RED:MUTED,true);symbol.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);symbol.setBackground(shape(active?(light?0xffffe5e9:0xff382132):PANEL,20));pad(symbol,15,5,15,5);item.addView(symbol);TextView label=txt(p,10,active?WHITE:MUTED,active);label.setGravity(Gravity.CENTER);pad(label,0,4,0,0);add(item,label);nav.addView(item,new LinearLayout.LayoutParams(0,dp(67),1));item.setOnClickListener(v->{if(p.equals(page))return;symbol.animate().scaleX(.83f).scaleY(.83f).setDuration(95).withEndAction(()->{symbol.animate().scaleX(1f).scaleY(1f).setDuration(130).start();show(p);}).start();});}add(root,nav);
